flowchart TB
    Settings[Privacy & Security settings] --> Manager[AdBlockManager]
    Manager --> Config[Profile-scoped AdBlockSettings]
    Manager --> Engine[AdBlockRuleEngine]
    Manager --> Stats[BlockStatistics]
    Manager --> Exceptions[SiteExceptionManager]
    Adapter[ChromiumAdBlockAdapter] --> Manager
    Engine --> Rules[Validated compiled rules]
    Rules --> Match[URL • domain • resource • context]
    Manager --> Privacy[PrivacyManager]
    Privacy --> Tracking[TrackingProtectionManager]
    Manager --> Resource[ResourceManager / PerformanceManager]
    Adapter --> Chromium[Supported Chromium interception]

